  "question": {
    "text": "If $|z-4| < |z-2|$, its solution is given by",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "2oawi",
      "text": "\nRe(z) > 0\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "Nacyl",
      "text": "\nRe(z)  < 0",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "vKUtl",
      "text": "\nRe (z) > 3\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    },
    {
      "id": "0Yb4r",
      "text": "\nRe(z) > 2",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Given $|z-4| < |z-2|$ Let $z=x+$ iy\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n& \\Rightarrow \\mid(x-4)+i y)| < |(x-2)+i y \\mid \\Rightarrow(x-4)^2+y^2 < (x-2)^2+y^2 \\\\\n& \\Rightarrow x^2-8 x+16 < x^2-4 x+4 \\Rightarrow 12 < 4 x \\Rightarrow x>3 \\Rightarrow \\operatorname{Re}(z)>3\n\\end{aligned}\n$$",
    "image": null
  },
